# Agon Wastes 05_portalpuzzle layer 0: EchoVisorWatcher PLCT e00120402. For tools/cov/specs/scriptplayerproxy.py:
# visor switches in and out of echo (Entered/Exited), the same while Deactivated (Think's inactive return), then
# Activate (a non-AreaLoaded message through HandleVisorMessage) and the other visors (not the watched one).
@f300 god 1; give echoVisor 1; give darkVisor 1; give scanVisor 1
@f340 obj e00120402
@f360 visor echo
@f440 obj e00120402
@f460 visor combat
@f540 visor echo
@f600 send e00120402 Deactivate
@f640 visor combat
@f700 send e00120402 Activate
@f760 visor scan
@f820 visor dark
@f880 visor echo
@f940 visor combat
@f1000 obj e00120402
